reels.title:
@adilqadriofficial has built one of India's biggest perfume brands by focusing on what most D2C founders miss: people don't come to Instagram to shop—they come to be entertained.

From ₹50 lakh/month in 2021 to ₹15 crore/month today, the brand has grown into a ₹150 crore business with a ₹300–350 crore valuation, 66 exclusive stores across India and Dubai, and over 10 lakh perfumes sold every month.

Watch the full Pitch to hear Adil's content philosophy, why entertainment beats selling, and how he's building the next phase of the brand through retail expansion and global markets.

